sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Writer
    participant E as Tiptap Editor
    participant CA as Content Analyzer
    participant AG as AI Gateway (BFF)
    participant F as FastAPI RAG
    participant L as Gemini LLM
    participant DB as Database

    U->>E: Types sentence ending . ? !
    E->>CA: analyzeSentence(text)
    CA->>CA: Match trigger rules<br/>vague / absolute / fact / long
    CA->>AG: fire matched engines (staggered 500ms)
    alt Interceptor / Socratic / Scaffold
        AG->>L: prompt (template from DB)
        L-->>AG: Socratic question / scaffold
    else Interceptor via SSE
        AG->>F: POST /api/ai/interceptor/stream
        F->>L: streaming generate
        L-->>F: tokens (SSE)
        F-->>AG: token stream
    end
    AG->>DB: persist Intervention (active)
    AG-->>E: intervention payload
    E->>E: add wavy underline decoration (2.5s debounce)
    U->>E: hover sentence
    E->>U: show popover + actionable next-steps
    U->>E: act (answer / dismiss / resolve)
    E->>DB: update userAction / status
